{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜基础选择","source_pdf_pages":[88],"item_ref":"ch02.basic.choice.001","item_kind":"choice","prompt":"分段函数 f(x)=(1−cos x)/√x(x>0)，x²φ(x)(x≤0)，φ 有界，在 0 处的性质。","topic_tags":["连续","可导","左右导数"],"type_pool":"可导与连续","options":[{"label":"A","statement":"可导","status":"correct","reason":"两侧极限均为0且左右导数均为0。"},{"label":"B","statement":"连续但不可导","status":"incorrect","reason":"导数存在。"},{"label":"C","statement":"极限存在但不连续","status":"incorrect","reason":"f(0)=0，极限等于函数值。"},{"label":"D","statement":"极限不存在","status":"incorrect","reason":"两侧均趋0。"}],"formal_answer":"A","official_analysis":"分别比较函数极限与左右差商。","independent_check":"(1−cos x)/x^(3/2)→0。","official_answer_source_pages":[29],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:20:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜基础选择","source_pdf_pages":[89],"item_ref":"ch02.basic.choice.002","item_kind":"choice","prompt":"f'(x) 存在，求 [f(x+aΔx)−f(x−bΔx)]/Δx 的极限。","topic_tags":["导数定义","增量"],"type_pool":"导数定义","options":[{"label":"A","statement":"(a+b)f'(x)","status":"correct","reason":"拆成两个差商，第二段分母取 −bΔx。"},{"label":"B","statement":"(a−b)f'(x)","status":"incorrect","reason":"符号拆分错误。"},{"label":"C","statement":"af'(x)","status":"incorrect","reason":"遗漏第二增量。"},{"label":"D","statement":"bf'(x)","status":"incorrect","reason":"遗漏第一增量。"}],"formal_answer":"A","official_analysis":"两段差商分别趋 a f'(x)、b f'(x)。","independent_check":"令 f(t)=t 可得 a+b。","official_answer_source_pages":[29],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:20:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜基础选择","source_pdf_pages":[90],"item_ref":"ch02.basic.choice.003","item_kind":"choice","prompt":"f(x)=√x/(√(1+x)+1)，判定 x=0 处右连续与右导数。","topic_tags":["右连续","右导数"],"type_pool":"可导与连续","options":[{"label":"A","statement":"连续且可导","status":"incorrect","reason":"题目仅给出定义域右侧，不能据此称双侧可导。"},{"label":"B","statement":"右连续但右导数不存在","status":"correct","reason":"差商约为1/(2√x)→∞。"},{"label":"C","statement":"右连续且右导数存在","status":"incorrect","reason":"右差商发散。"},{"label":"D","statement":"右极限存在且右导数存在","status":"incorrect","reason":"右导数不存在。"}],"formal_answer":"B","official_analysis":"右极限为 f(0)=0；右差商无界。","independent_check":"有理化后 f(x)/x=1/[√x(√(1+x)+1)]。","official_answer_source_pages":[29],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:20:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜基础选择","source_pdf_pages":[91],"item_ref":"ch02.basic.choice.004","item_kind":"choice","prompt":"f(x)=a√x(0≤x≤b)，ln x(x>b)，在 (0,∞) 可导且 0 处右连续，求 (a,b)。","topic_tags":["分段函数","可导","连续"],"type_pool":"可导与连续","options":[{"label":"A","statement":"a=2/e，b=e²","status":"correct","reason":"接点连续 ln b=a√b，左右导数相等 a/(2√b)=1/b。"},{"label":"B","statement":"a=2/e，b=e","status":"incorrect","reason":"不满足两条件联立。"},{"label":"C","statement":"a=1/e，b=e²","status":"incorrect","reason":"导数不匹配。"},{"label":"D","statement":"a=1/e，b=e","status":"incorrect","reason":"导数不匹配。"}],"formal_answer":"A","official_analysis":"先排 b=0，再在接点联立连续与可导。","independent_check":"代 b=e² 得 a=2/e。","official_answer_source_pages":[29,30],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:20:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜基础选择","source_pdf_pages":[92],"item_ref":"ch02.basic.choice.005","item_kind":"choice","prompt":"f(x)=|x²+3x+2|/|x³−x| 的不可导点个数。","topic_tags":["绝对值","不可导"],"type_pool":"可导与连续","options":[{"label":"A","statement":"1","status":"incorrect","reason":"遗漏约分后绝对值尖点。"},{"label":"B","statement":"2","status":"correct","reason":"化为 |x+2||x+1|/(|x||x+1||x−1|)，x=0、1 为不可导点。"},{"label":"C","statement":"3","status":"incorrect","reason":"x=−1 可去且约分后不构成不可导点。"},{"label":"D","statement":"4","status":"incorrect","reason":"定义域与约分后的尖点需分辨。"}],"formal_answer":"B","official_analysis":"先因式分解并核原定义域。","independent_check":"官方解给不可导点 x=0,1。","official_answer_source_pages":[30],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:20:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜基础选择","source_pdf_pages":[93],"item_ref":"ch02.basic.choice.006","item_kind":"choice","prompt":"下列在 x=0 处不可导的函数。","topic_tags":["左右导数","复合函数"],"type_pool":"可导与连续","options":[{"label":"A","statement":"|x|sin|x|","status":"incorrect","reason":"在0附近约为 x² 的量级，导数为0。"},{"label":"B","statement":"|x|sin x","status":"incorrect","reason":"两侧差商均趋0。"},{"label":"C","statement":"cos|x|","status":"incorrect","reason":"左右差商均为0。"},{"label":"D","statement":"cos√|x|","status":"correct","reason":"左右导数分别为 −1/2、1/2。"}],"formal_answer":"D","official_analysis":"按导数定义比较左右极限。","independent_check":"cos√|x|−1~−|x|/2。","official_answer_source_pages":[30],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:20:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜基础选择","source_pdf_pages":[94],"item_ref":"ch02.basic.choice.007","item_kind":"choice","prompt":"f'(x₀)=1/2 时，微分 dy 是 Δx 的何种无穷小。","topic_tags":["微分定义"],"type_pool":"微分","options":[{"label":"A","statement":"等价","status":"incorrect","reason":"比值 dy/Δx→1/2≠1。"},{"label":"B","statement":"同阶但不等价","status":"correct","reason":"dy=f'(x₀)Δx。"},{"label":"C","statement":"低阶","status":"incorrect","reason":"比值不趋0。"},{"label":"D","statement":"高阶","status":"incorrect","reason":"比值不趋∞。"}],"formal_answer":"B","official_analysis":"由 dy=f'(x₀)Δx。","independent_check":"常数非零且不为1即同阶不等价。","official_answer_source_pages":[30],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:20:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜基础选择","source_pdf_pages":[97],"item_ref":"ch02.basic.choice.010","item_kind":"choice","prompt":"f 连续、f(0)=0，lim f(x)/(1−cos x)=2，判定 0 处性质。","topic_tags":["可导","极值","等价无穷小"],"type_pool":"可导与连续","options":[{"label":"A","statement":"不可导","status":"incorrect","reason":"f(x)~x²，差商趋0。"},{"label":"B","statement":"可导且 f'(0)≠0","status":"incorrect","reason":"f'(0)=0。"},{"label":"C","statement":"有极小值","status":"correct","reason":"极限比为正且 1−cos x>0，邻域内 f(x)>f(0)。"},{"label":"D","statement":"有极大值","status":"incorrect","reason":"邻域函数值为正。"}],"formal_answer":"C","official_analysis":"先由导数定义算 f'(0)=0，再用保号性。","independent_check":"f(x)/(1−cos x)→2>0。","official_answer_source_pages":[30],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:20:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜基础选择","source_pdf_pages":[100],"item_ref":"ch02.basic.choice.013","item_kind":"choice","prompt":"f 有一阶连续导数，F(x)=f(x)(1+|sin x|)，f(0)=0 是否为 F 在0可导的条件。","topic_tags":["可导","绝对值"],"type_pool":"可导与连续","options":[{"label":"A","statement":"必要非充分","status":"incorrect","reason":"条件充分且必要。"},{"label":"B","statement":"充分非必要","status":"incorrect","reason":"左右导数差为2f(0)，可导必有 f(0)=0。"},{"label":"C","statement":"充分必要","status":"correct","reason":"F'_+(0)=f'(0)+f(0)，F'_−(0)=f'(0)−f(0)。"},{"label":"D","statement":"既非充分又非必要","status":"incorrect","reason":"与左右导数结论矛盾。"}],"formal_answer":"C","official_analysis":"按 |sin x| 的左右形式求导数。","independent_check":"两侧相等当且仅当 f(0)=0。","official_answer_source_pages":[31],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:20:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜基础选择","source_pdf_pages":[101],"item_ref":"ch02.basic.choice.014","item_kind":"choice","prompt":"已知 f 在 a 连续，哪一条件足以保证 f 在 a 可导。","topic_tags":["可导充分条件","对称差商"],"type_pool":"导数定义","options":[{"label":"A","statement":"lim_{x→∞}|x|[f(a+1/|x|)−f(a)] 存在","status":"incorrect","reason":"可能是无穷或仅右导数信息。"},{"label":"B","statement":"lim_{x→0}[f(a+x³)−f(a)]/x² 存在","status":"incorrect","reason":"可为0·∞型，不能保证。"},{"label":"C","statement":"对称差商 lim_{Δx→0}[f(a+Δx)−f(a−Δx)]/(2Δx) 存在","status":"incorrect","reason":"对称导数存在不推出可导。"},{"label":"D","statement":"lim_{x→0}[f(a+x³)−f(a)]/tan(x³) 存在","status":"correct","reason":"令 h=x³，tan h~h，得到双侧导数。"}],"formal_answer":"D","official_analysis":"逐项辨别左右差商是否均受控。","independent_check":"D 的极限即 f'(a)。","official_answer_source_pages":[31,32],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:20:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜基础选择","source_pdf_pages":[104],"item_ref":"ch02.basic.choice.017","item_kind":"choice","prompt":"|f(x)|≤x²（x 在0邻域），判定 f 在0的性质。","topic_tags":["可导","夹逼准则"],"type_pool":"导数定义","options":[{"label":"A","statement":"间断点","status":"incorrect","reason":"|f(x)|≤x²→0，且 f(0)=0。"},{"label":"B","statement":"连续但不可导","status":"incorrect","reason":"差商绝对值≤|x|→0。"},{"label":"C","statement":"可导且 f'(0)=0","status":"correct","reason":"夹逼于0。"},{"label":"D","statement":"可导且 f'(0)≠0","status":"incorrect","reason":"导数只能为0。"}],"formal_answer":"C","official_analysis":"先由 x=0 得 f(0)=0，再夹逼差商。","independent_check":"|[f(x)−f(0)]/x|≤|x|。","official_answer_source_pages":[31],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:20:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
